---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import "../styles/policy-pages.css";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Review | HVAC Training Solutions"
  description="Privacy information for the HVAC Training Solutions development site, with the details that must be confirmed before its public launch."
>
  <section class="policy-hero"><div class="policy-hero-inner"><p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p><h1>How this site handles your visit.</h1><p>This development version has a limited set of ways to contact us and explore the current Boot Camp. We are reviewing the complete privacy notice before the new marketing site replaces the existing one.</p></div></section>
  <div class="page-shell policy-layout">
    <article class="policy-body">
      <div class="policy-review"><strong>Development review — privacy notice pending approval</strong><p>This page describes the visible features of the new marketing site. It does not yet describe every data practice of checkout, the student course site, analytics, or connected services. The final notice must be approved before the public launch.</p></div>

      <h2>What you can do on this marketing site</h2>
      <p>You can read the Boot Camp details and free articles, watch a public video lesson, and follow links to contact us, schedule a call, visit the current checkout, or sign in to the existing student course. The current development pages do not have an on-site inquiry or enrollment form.</p>
      <p>If you email us, your message and address go through your email provider and ours so we can respond. Please do not send payment card details or other sensitive information by email.</p>

      <h2>Other services you may open</h2>
      <p>The lesson page contains a YouTube video player. Scheduling opens Calendly; student login opens the existing Moodle site at <a href="https://hvactraining.academy/">hvactraining.academy</a>; enrollment currently opens the existing WordPress checkout and PayPal payment flow. Those services have their own privacy information and may process data when you interact with them.</p>
      <p>Cloudflare delivers this development site. At the public launch, Google Analytics 4 is planned to help us understand visits and steps toward enrollment. We will update this notice to reflect the actual configuration and applicable choices before enabling that measurement on the new marketing site.</p>

      <h2>Ask about your information</h2>
      <p>For a privacy question about the existing course, an inquiry you sent, or a purchase, email <a href="mailto:hvactrainingsolutions@gmail.com">hvactrainingsolutions@gmail.com</a>. Describe the service you used so Ron can find the right records; do not include your password or full payment information.</p>

      <div class="policy-action"><h2>Considering enrollment?</h2><p>Review the current course, payment options, and contact information before paying.</p><a class="button button-dark" href="/pricing/">See Boot Camp pricing</a></div>
    </article>
    <aside class="policy-aside" aria-label="Related information"><strong>Related pages</strong><a href="/terms/">Course terms review</a><a href="/refund-policy/">Refund information</a><a href="/contact/">Contact Ron</a></aside>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
